---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="What Almanac is and how it works.">
  <div class="container container--narrow prose">
    <span class="kicker">About</span>
    <h1>A morning brief on dentistry</h1>

    <p>Almanac is a one-page-a-day curated brief covering the dental literature and dental world: what changed today in conservative dentistry, endodontics, periodontology, implantology, orthodontics, and the regulatory and educational corners that don't fit a specialty box.</p>

    <p>It exists because reading the journals, the trade press, and the Czech regulatory feeds every morning is a chore — and skipping a day means missing the thing that mattered.</p>

    <h2>What lands here</h2>
    <p>Each morning at 06:00 Prague, a script fetches every source listed on <a href={`${base}/sources/`}>the sources page</a>. Claude (Sonnet 4.6) reads the candidate items, picks the ten most worth your time, classifies each into a specialty, and writes a short summary in the source's original language. The result is rendered as static HTML and shipped to GitHub Pages.</p>

    <h2>What does <em>not</em> land here</h2>
    <p>Marketing dressed as news. Influencer chairside videos. US insurance billing minutiae. Press releases that never become a published study. If a story doesn't change practice, change policy, or change the evidence base, it gets cut.</p>

    <h2>Why the bilingual summaries</h2>
    <p>Czech sources (ČSK, LKS) are too important to translate away — Czech stays Czech. International sources stay in English. Every item carries a language chip so you know what you're getting before you click.</p>

    <h2>The site itself</h2>
    <p>Built on Astro. Zero JavaScript by default — the only interactive elements are the theme toggle and the settings page. Self-hosted Fraunces and Inter, no Google Fonts at runtime, no analytics, no tracking. The whole repo is open: <a href="https://github.com/michalsvobodapro/almanac">view on GitHub</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
